Free-format RPG IV (ILE RPG) tree-sitter grammar
  Path:      crates/wicked-estate-extract/vendor/tree-sitter-rpg/
  Crate:     wicked-estate-tree-sitter-rpg (v0.1.2)
  Origin:    In-house — authored in this repository
             (https://github.com/mikeparcewski/wicked-estate); not imported
             from an upstream grammar.
  License:   MIT (Copyright (c) 2026 Michael Parcewski)

  This grammar was hand-authored via the "template-extrapolate" method:
  its structure was patterned after existing tree-sitter grammars, while the
  rules were written for RPG free-form syntax. It is a symbols+calls subset,
  not a full-language grammar. No third-party grammar source was copied into
  it; the structural patterning carries no upstream copyright obligation.
